- Keep secondary destinations accessible through a menu.
- Avoid horizontal overflow.
- Ensure touch targets are sufficiently large.
- Make dialogs, forms, and task editors usable on narrow screens.
- Keep important actions reachable without awkward scrolling.

Use a single coherent navigation system across breakpoints.

### Main navigation

Implement navigation for the following product areas:

- Dashboard
- My Tasks
- Projects
- Calendar
- Settings

Include additional destinations only when supported by the actual product scope.

The navigation must indicate the active destination clearly and preserve a consistent experience across all pages.

